---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HeroHeader from "../../components/HeroHeader.astro";
import PublicEmail from "../../components/PublicEmail.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | Made by Kreativ"
  description="Website analytics, local preferences, storefronts, and Android app privacy policies."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <HeroHeader
    eyebrow="Effective 11 November 2026"
    title="Privacy"
    tagline="How this website and its linked services handle information."
  />
  <section class="ptp-section">
    <h2>The website</h2>
    <p>
      This website is operated by Andrei Olaru, trading as Made by Kreativ, in
      Bucharest, Romania. It is hosted on GitHub Pages. Hosting and network
      providers receive technical request information needed to deliver and
      protect the website.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use Plausible for page views, clicks on navigation, product and service
      links, and counts of prepared project briefs, and Cloudflare Web Analytics for performance and usage
      measurements. We do not send names, email addresses, search text, payment
      details, or download contents to these analytics tools. Product click
      properties describe the product, page, and button position, not the
      visitor. The website does not use advertising trackers.
    </p>
    <p>Service inquiry events contain only the page and a fixed package or service identifier. Brief text, budgets, deadlines, relevant links and clipboard contents are not sent to analytics. A prepared brief or inquiry click is not recorded as a sent email or confirmed engagement.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible's data policy</a>{" "}
      describes event processing, approximate location, and daily visitor
      identifiers without persistent tracking cookies.{" "}
      <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">
        Cloudflare's Web Analytics documentation
      </a>{" "}
      explains its performance measurements. These services have their own
      processing and retention practices; this page is not a claim that no
      network data is processed.
    </p>
    <h2>Your preferences</h2>
    <p>
      Your light or dark theme is saved in local storage as{" "}
      <code>kreativ-theme</code>. This preference stays in your browser and can
      be removed through your browser's site-data settings. You can block
      analytics requests with browser privacy tools.
    </p>
    <h2>Purchases and contact</h2>
    <p>The project inquiry builder prepares an email draft in your browser tab. It does not upload your brief, send an email automatically or save the fields in browser storage. Copy actions write to your device clipboard only when you choose them. If you open and send the draft, your chosen email service handles that message.</p>
    <p>
      Gumroad handles product checkout, delivery, payment, and buyer information
      under <a href="https://gumroad.com/privacy">its privacy policy</a>.
      Product links contain campaign labels identifying this website and the
      link position; these do not identify you. A storefront click is not
      recorded here as a completed purchase.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you email us, we receive the information you choose to send and use it
      to respond and handle the request. Avoid sending sensitive personal
      information or payment-card details. Contact{" "}
      <PublicEmail /> for
      privacy questions or requests about information you have provided.
    </p>
    <h2>Android apps</h2>
    <p>
      The website's analytics do not run inside these apps. Their permissions,
      local processing, and optional Google Play purchases are covered
      separately:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="/privacy/sharesafe/">ShareSafe privacy policy</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/privacy/northlight/">Northlight privacy policy</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/privacy/blockshift/">BLOCKSHIFT privacy policy</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/privacy/kreativ-fancy-text/">Kreativ Fancy Text privacy policy</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/privacy/photofeather/">PhotoFeather privacy policy</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Changes to this notice will be published here with a revised effective
      date.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
